  "definition": "Wiring and Control Devices",
  "effectiveDate": "2024-12-25",
  "historyNote": "(See Revision Note at part heading for Env-Dw 405) #10612, eff 6-1-14; ss by #14158, eff 12-25-24 (formerly Env-Dw 405.25)",
